Z||000000||Pretender||03-23-99||01:45 AM||||My car sat for a year and a half, while it sat the oil pan rusted through...i called the fiero store and  was about to order a brand new pan untill i heard the price...The sales person reccomended his used parts guy...so i called him and had the oip pan sent....when it arrived it was SPRAY PAINTED!!..inside and out...it doesn't take a genious to know not to paint the inside of the pan..i had to get it dipped and sandblasted at the local Napa before installation...i thought i would just tell you guys/gals incase you ever needed an oil pan from the "used parts guy" via the Fiero Store....<br>
